# What macshot.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# knows this tool exists. Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Olm's lib/deps.lua for the kinds and for how these files are found.
# Optional, because the native backend always handles screenshots and recording, so a
# missing one costs the preferred backend rather than the spoon.
macshot | app | com.sw33tlie.macshot.macshot | optional | the preferred screenshot backend, native is the fallback
